        "paragraphs": [
          "In the first request, 1 matches {id} and is read by @PathVariable. In the second, id=1 is a query parameter read by @RequestParam. Both delegate to the same employee service.",
          "The explicit annotation name connects the incoming value to the Java parameter. It also lets the request name differ from the Java variable name."
        ]
