        "path": "src/main/java/com/codesnippet/course/lesson04/dto/EmployeeDto.java",
        "text": "package com.codesnippet.course.lesson04.dto;\n\npublic class EmployeeDto {\n    private String name;\n    private String department;\n    private Integer age;\n    public EmployeeDto() {}\n    public EmployeeDto(String name, String department, Integer age) {\n        this.name = name;\n        this.department = department;\n        this.age = age;\n    }\n    public String getName() { return name; }\n    public void setName(String name) { this.name = name; }\n    public String getDepartment() { return department; }\n    public void setDepartment(String department) { this.department = department; }\n    public Integer getAge() { return age; }\n    public void setAge(Integer age) { this.age = age; }\n}\n",
        "explain": [
          "This is the employee response shape. Its fields have getters so the controller response can be serialized as JSON.",
          "Leaving the internal entity ID out of this class keeps that field out of this response."
        ]
