        "text": "package com.codesnippet.course.lesson09;\n\nimport org.springframework.stereotype.Component;\nimport org.springframework.web.context.annotation.SessionScope;\n@Component\n@SessionScope\npublic class SessionState { public int identity() { return System.identityHashCode(this); } }\n",
        "explain": [
          "This managed object belongs to the HTTP session. Its identity is reused across requests carrying that same session cookie.",
          "Invalidating the session ends that reuse boundary; the next session receives a different target instance."
        ]
