        "path": "src/main/java/com/codesnippet/course/lesson13/entity/Product.java",
        "text": "package com.codesnippet.course.lesson13.entity;\n\nimport jakarta.persistence.*;\n@Entity\npublic class Product {\n    @Id\n    @GeneratedValue(strategy=GenerationType.IDENTITY)\n    private Integer id;\n    private String name;\n    public Product() {}\n    public Product(Integer id, String name) {\n        this.id = id;\n        this.name = name;\n    }\n    public Integer getId() { return id; }\n    public void setId(Integer id) { this.id = id; }\n    public String getName() { return name; }\n    public void setName(String name) { this.name = name; }\n}\n",
        "explain": [
          "This entity describes the stored product fields. The identifier distinguishes one stored product from another.",
          "Accessors allow request binding and response serialization in these local examples. The examples use a small field set to keep the feature under study visible."
        ]
