          "The example enables matchIfMissing on both providers and recreates the ambiguity. Keep the fallback on only the intended default in this example.",
          "The email example uses feature.email.enabled with havingValue = \"true\". Its constructor message appears when enabled and disappears when the flag is false. These conditions govern bean registration; they are not a demonstrated live switch for an already created context."
